# Happy New Year — original story and translation by Claude (Anthropic).
# Target: HSK 3.0 level 1; focus grammar: 一起, 和, 都, 过 (过新年), 一边……一边……; names N.

@meta {"title_zh": "新年好", "subtitle_zh": "爷爷奶奶家的新年", "title_en": "Happy New Year", "subtitle_en": "New Year at Grandpa and Grandma's", "author": "Text and translation by Claude (Anthropic)"}

